Test data not in this repository
--------------------------------

fixtures/ and the design-derived golden files under
packages/core/test/golden are NOT in the repository: real embroidery
designs (personal designs, community designs shared within the
maintainer's group, and a factory sample shipped with a Zeng Hsing
machine) used as private test data for interoperability work — not
redistributable content, and not covered by any license granted here.
The test suite self-skips when they are absent; the full suite runs on
the maintainer's machine.
